; One variable against unit-sub-viewport-container-shrink-2d-content.tscn: the content kind. A 3D
; subtree fills the target, which stores sRGB bytes, so the magnified edge blends the stored
; numbers as the 2D target does. The unshaded orange quad ends at target column 50, where Godot
; 4.6.3 reads (199,180) rgb(210, 96, 19) and (200,180) rgb(121, 83, 57).

